    {
      "parameters": {
        "chatId": "={{ $('Route').item.json.targetChatId }}",
        "text": "=Hai {{ $json.name }}! Permintaan anda diluluskan. Ini URL connector docs-publisher peribadi anda:\n\n{{ $json.url }}\n\nCara pasang: claude.ai → Customize → Connectors → + Add → Add custom connector. Nama: docs-publisher. URL: tampal URL di atas.\n\nPanduan penuh: https://arfzkwn-coder.github.io/docsXAi/docs/set-up-in-claude\n\nRahsiakan URL ini, ia seperti kata laluan. Padam mesej ini selepas anda menambah connector.",
        "additionalFields": {
